@startuml statusy
' Diagram stanów dokumentu (STATUS_TRANSITIONS i ROLE_STATUS_TRANSITIONS
' w shared/src/documents.ts): [K] – zmianę wykonuje kierowca, [B] – biuro.
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state "Roboczy\nDRAFT" as DRAFT
state "Przesłany\nSUBMITTED" as SUBMITTED
state "Zaakceptowany\nACCEPTED" as ACCEPTED
state "Odrzucony\nREJECTED" as REJECTED
state "Zarchiwizowany\nARCHIVED" as ARCHIVED

[*] --> DRAFT : [K] dodanie dokumentu
DRAFT --> SUBMITTED : [K] przesłanie do biura
SUBMITTED --> DRAFT : [K] wycofanie
SUBMITTED --> ACCEPTED : [B] akceptacja
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : [B] odrzucenie\n(z powodem)
REJECTED --> DRAFT : [K] poprawa
REJECTED --> SUBMITTED : [K] ponowne przesłanie
DRAFT --> ARCHIVED : [K]
REJECTED --> ARCHIVED : [K]
ACCEPTED --> ARCHIVED : [K]
ARCHIVED --> [*]
note right of ARCHIVED : tylko do odczytu
@enduml
